19. Test Scenarios

The following scenarios should be validated before production implementation.

Test 1 – Normal Operation

Expected:

Qlik → FQDN → LB → Current Primary

Test 2 – Planned EFM Switchover

Expected:

Primary changes
       ↓
EFM health status changes
       ↓
LB identifies new primary
       ↓
New connections go to new primary

Test 3 – Unplanned Primary Failure

Expected:

Primary failure
       ↓
EFM promotion
       ↓
LB detects new primary
       ↓
Qlik reconnects

Test 4 – Old Primary Returns

Expected:

Old primary returns
       ↓
Node rejoins as standby
       ↓
LB does NOT route Qlik traffic to it

Test 5 – Health Check Failure

Expected:

EFM endpoint unavailable
       ↓
LB removes node from eligible pool

Test 6 – Qlik Reconnect

Validate:

- Connection retry
- Job restart behavior
- Data extraction continuity
- Error handling
- Duplicate/incomplete data handling, if applicable

